## Technical Details

This skill uses the Chrome DevTools Protocol to communicate with the browser and capture the full page content. It supports various formats and can handle complex page layouts.

## Output

The skill provides:
- Screenshot file (PNG or JPEG)
- Page metadata (URL, title, dimensions)
- Optional console logs

## Authentication

This skill requires a running browser instance and does not require additional authentication beyond having a browser session.

